@startuml
title Reviewer Response Activity Diagram
|Reviewer|
start
:Receive Invitation Email;
:Respond to Invitation;
if (Decline Assignment?) then (Yes)
  :Request to Decline Assignment;
  :Provide Reason;
  |Coordinator|
  :Process Decline Request;
  if (Approve Decline?) then (Yes)
    :Reassign Reviewer;
    stop
  else (No, Deny Decline)
  endif
else (No)
endif

|Reviewer|
:Access Paper;

if (Need more time?) then (Yes, Extension Req)
  :Request Deadline Extension;
  :Provide Reason;
  |Coordinator|
  :Process Extension Request;
  if (Approve?) then (Yes)
    :Update Deadline;
  else (No)
    :Keep Original Deadline;
  endif
else (No)
endif

|Reviewer|
:Submit Review Feedback;
:Mark Review Completed;
stop
@enduml
